-- Onyxia's Lair (map 249), walk 2b: the Deep Breath seats for Onyxia 10184's eight hover points.
--
-- Her P2 moves are breaths from her hover point i to i+4: a 5 s cast (stopped, targetless), then a chain of
-- ground ticks along the lane every 0.25-0.32 s, each hitting every player within 30 yd 2D. The breath from
-- the north point runs past point 3 into the tunnel (21-28 k a tick); the west end is a death zone on it.
-- Each breath gets one stand anchor (id = hover point + 1) at the hover point, radius 6, opening on that
-- point's breath spell while she hovers (aura 17131, signal stopped_no_target) and releasing at the far
-- point's anchor; hold 12 s (5 s cast + at most 4.6 s of ticks + margin). Every seat is floor all round
-- (checked by offline path-check from both tunnel stairs), within 59 yd of the room-centre anchor
-- (-22.0, -213.5) and 78 yd of its hover point (the stand's 80 yd member range), at least 14 yd from every
-- egg, and more than 33 yd from every tick point of its lane; single-seat rows on a 2.83 yd lattice (no
-- Fireball during a breath). Per side the seats nearest the lane go to healers (10), then ranged (16), then
-- melee (13, tanks included, so slot 1 walks Cindarion out of the lane with it). A seated bot keeps its seat
-- instead of the generic breath dodge (needs AiPlayerbot.BossStandOutranksBreathDodge = 1).
--
-- Generator (audit tree, tests/raid-ony-walk2/ony_breath_seats.py; offline path-checks only, no server):
-- python3 -I ony_breath_seats.py ~/tortoise-wow-wt/scan-1181dev/sql/base ~/ta-ony1-bin/turtle-agent ~/turtle-agent-mmaps <out-values.sql>
